{
  "_comment": "Zariadenia pre fota_remote_e2e.py. transport: 'com' (lokálny COM port) alebo 'rpi' (SSH+tmux+picocom). kind určuje build env a prefix archívu v builds/. path_to = direct LoRa cesta z companiona k zariadeniu (hex 1B hashe hopov).",
