    "_comment": "prefix = archív builds/<prefix>.fw_N.*; pio_zip=true = bez archívu, flashuje sa .pio/build/<env>/firmware.zip; method=pio-upload = ESP32 (pio run -t upload), inak nRF serial DFU",
